OL,3,GNEWSACharity boss hits out at
OL,4,A'mind-blowing' van theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FA food bank boss said it was
OL,7,F"mind-blowing" that thieves had put its
OL,8,Fvan out of action by stealing its
OL,9,Fengine.
OL,11,FSteve Clay, chief executive of
OL,12,FCambridge City Foodbank, said the
OL,13,Fcharity's primary mode of transport had
OL,14,Fbeen written off after being towed from
OL,15,Fits warehouse and abandoned nearby,
OL,16,Fwith its engine compartment completely
OL,17,Fremoved.
OL,19,F"It's mind-blowing, really, to think
OL,20,Fthat somebody could be so callous,"
OL,21,FClay said.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
